    # game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/logic_BigTroubleLH.rpy:25
    old "Big Trouble in Little Hamun"
    new "Gran problema en pequeño Hamun"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/logic_BigTroubleLH.rpy:26
    old "Marbella is in trouble. It seems the Greater Trading Company wants to snuff out her mining company before it's even begun. I need to find some protection for her..."
    new "Marbella está en problemas. Parece que la Gran Compañía Comercial quiere acabar con su empresa minera antes de que siquiera empiece. Necesito encontrar alguna protección para ella..."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/logic_BigTroubleLH.rpy:27
    old "Speak to Lord Zanzibat"
    new "Habla con lord Zanzibat"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/logic_BigTroubleLH.rpy:27
    old "Maybe a Merchant Lord could help?"
    new "¿Quizás un lord mercader podría ayudar?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/logic_BigTroubleLH.rpy:27
    old "Speak to Marbella or look for someone else to help out"
    new "Habla con Marbella o busca a alguien más que te ayude."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/logic_BigTroubleLH.rpy:27
    old "In return for his help dealing with the GTC, Lord Zanzibat wants me to wipe out the Khazah gang who have set up shop in Hamun. I should speak to Marbella about his offer... \n\nBut maybe The Khazah themselves have a counteroffer? Or, I could try have some sort of a protection device crafted for Marbella, so that she doesn't need to rely on others?"
    new "A cambio de su ayuda para lidiar con la GCC, lord Zanzibat quiere que elimine a la banda Khazah que se ha establecido en Hamun. Debería hablar con Marbella sobre su oferta... \n\n¿Pero tal vez los propios Khazah tengan una contraoferta? O, ¿podría intentar que le fabricaran algún tipo de dispositivo de protección para Marbella, para que no tenga que depender de otros?"

